# Keep historical code, model artifacts, data, runs and credentials out of images.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements_aws.txt
!requirements_nyx_annual_cpu.txt
!requirements_console.txt
!nyx_runtime/
!nyx_runtime/**
!production/
!production/**
production/outputs/
production/config.local.json
production/runtime/data/
production/runtime/runs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
